classDiagram
    note for CatalogManager "internal/catalog 独占目录同步；Catalog Cache 与 Skill/Agent/Plugin 制品缓存是不同边界（ADR-021）"

    class CatalogManager {
        <<interface>>
        +Snapshot(Context) (Snapshot, SyncStatus, error)
        +SnapshotLocked(Context) (Snapshot, SyncStatus, error)
    }
    class CatalogSource {
        <<interface: internal/cloud.CatalogSource>>
        +CatalogVersion(Context) CatalogVersion
        +DownloadCatalog(Context, destination) error
    }
    class CatalogRepository {
        <<interface>>
        +Load() (Snapshot, CatalogVersion, error)
        +Replace(CatalogVersion, sourcePath) Snapshot
    }
    class CatalogSnapshot {
        +List(PowerType) []CatalogEntry
        +Resolve(PowerRef) CatalogEntry
        +Metadata(PowerRef) CatalogEntry
    }
    class CatalogFile {
        <<~/.apm/catalog.json, mode 0600>>
    }
    class GlobalLock {
        <<apm.lock, non-blocking>>
    }
    CatalogManager --> CatalogSource : version and optional full download
    CatalogManager --> CatalogRepository : strict load and atomic replace
    CatalogManager --> GlobalLock : Snapshot only
    CatalogRepository --> CatalogFile : exact bytes, SHA-256 and size
    CatalogManager --> CatalogSnapshot : returns immutable clone boundary
    note for CatalogRepository "拒绝 symlink、hardlink、不可信目录和可检测替换；current EUID 是 pathname trusted actor，advisory lock 不隔离恶意同 EUID 写者"

    class CacheSource {
        <<interface: internal/cache.Source>>
        +DownloadSkill(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
        +DownloadAgent(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
    }
    class PowerCache {
        <<interface: internal/cache.PowerCache>>
        +PrepareSkill(Context, CatalogEntry) stagingRoot
        +PrepareAgent(Context, CatalogEntry) stagingRoot
    }
    class FilesystemCache {
        <<internal/cache.FilesystemCache>>
    }
    class VersionedPowerCache {
        <<cache/skills or cache/agents/name/version>>
    }
    class PublicStaging {
        <<staging/skills or staging/agents/name>>
    }
    FilesystemCache ..|> PowerCache
    FilesystemCache --> CacheSource : forwards one authoritative entry on miss
    FilesystemCache --> VersionedPowerCache : validates immutable exact version
    FilesystemCache --> PublicStaging : atomically materializes staging
    note for FilesystemCache "cache hit 复验 identity；损坏或不匹配时 fail closed，不下载覆盖。Agent hit/miss 都校验 agent.yaml 与 entry.Ref"

    class PluginResource {
        <<internal/pluginresource.Manager>>
        +Ensure(Context, CatalogEntry) Artifact
        +Lookup(PowerRef) Artifact
        +StageFilesystem(PowerRef) stagingRoot
    }
    class PluginDownloader {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadPlugin(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
    }
    class PluginArtifactCache {
        <<cache/plugins/name/version>>
    }
    class PluginArtifactLookup {
        <<read-only uninstall boundary>>
        +Lookup(PowerRef) Artifact
    }
    PluginResource --> PluginDownloader : Ensure miss forwards target entry
    PluginResource --> PluginArtifactCache : publishes shared immutable artifact
    PluginArtifactLookup --> PluginArtifactCache : uninstall reads only
    note for PluginArtifactCache "Plugin cache 不属于 PowerCache；canonical apc-plugin 派生原生 manifest 与双 marketplace。Uninstall/Fix 不下载或重建"
